clarificationPromptTemplate:
Analyze the following user story and acceptance criteria:
User Story: {userStory}
Acceptance Criteria: {acceptanceCriteria}
Available Metadata: {metadataSnapshot}

Task: Identify any ambiguities, missing field definitions, unconfirmed business logic, or unclear personas. Formulate concise, numbered clarifying questions required before technical design can proceed.

solutionRecommendationTemplate:
Generate a comprehensive technical solution plan for the approved requirement:
User Story: {userStory}
Acceptance Criteria: {acceptanceCriteria}
Clarified Details: {clarifications}
Available Metadata: {metadataSnapshot}

Provide your analysis structured as:
1. Architecture Strategy: Classify as Declarative (Flow), Programmatic (Apex/LWC), or Hybrid, citing explicit technical justifications.
2. Component Impact Matrix: List impacted Objects, Fields, Flows, Apex classes, and Permissions.
3. Detailed Implementation Steps: Step-by-step developer build instructions.
4. Quality & Governor Risk Analysis: Bulk volume risks, recursion prevention, transaction boundary checks.
5. Test Scenarios: Positive, negative, edge, and bulk test cases with expected assertions.
6. OWASP LLM & Security Guardrails: Highlight data security, CRUD/FLS, and human review checkpoints.
